{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04437","headline":"夏日晖上人房别李参军崇嗣 · 陈子昂","name":"夏日晖上人房别李参军崇嗣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四十九变化，一十三死生。\n翕忽玄黄里，驱驰风雨情。\n是非纷妄作，宠辱坐相惊。\n至人独幽鉴，窈窕随昏明。\n咫尺山河道，轩窗日月庭。\n别离焉足问，悲乐固能幷。\n我辈何爲尔，栖皇犹未平。\n金台可攀陟，宝界绝将迎。\n户牖观天地，阶基上杳冥。\n自超三界乐，安知万里征。\n中国要荒内，人寰宇宙荣。\n弦望如朝夕，宁嗟蜀道行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04437.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04437","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}